   "text": "You won the penalties off the top scorer, in front of everyone, on a Thursday. He still says he let you."
  },
  {
   "id": "his-penalties",
   "title": "His penalties",
   "text": "The top scorer kept the penalties. He's scored most of them. You still think about the one he took off you."
